      "before": "kpk1-l05-c4-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Pracować: where do you work?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Pracować* drops *-ować* and adds *-uj-* before the endings: *pracuję*, *pracujesz*, *pracuje*, *pracujemy*, *pracujecie*, *pracują*. *Gdzie pracujesz?* asks a friend where they work. The answer is *w* and the place with a new ending: *w szpitalu*, *w biurze*, *w teatrze*. For now, learn each as a whole."
      },
      "conjugation": {
        "verb": "pracować",
        "meaning": {
          "en": "to work"
        },
        "forms": {
          "ja": "pracuję",
          "ty": "pracujesz",
          "on": "pracuje",
          "my": "pracujemy",
          "wy": "pracujecie",
          "oni": "pracują"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
